{"question_id": "V2-dev-LAW-en-T2-002", "approach": "B1", "approach_base": "B1", "flags": {}, "setting": "en-en", "q_lang": "en", "d_lang": "en", "corpus": "L", "corpus_set": "LAW_en", "answer_text": "The contract may impose a notice period of at most two months, the transition may last at most 30 calendar days, and the provider may charge only reduced switching charges.\n\n- Article 25(d): the maximum notice period for initiating the switching process shall not exceed two months.\n- Article 25(a): switching must occur without undue delay and in any event not after the mandatory maximum transitional period of 30 calendar days, initiated after the notice period, during which the provider must assist the customer, maintain business continuity, give information on risks, and keep a high level of security.\n- Article 29(2): from 11 January 2024 to 12 January 2027, providers may impose reduced switching charges (March 2026 falls in this period).\n- Article 29(3): those reduced charges shall not exceed the costs directly linked to the switching process.", "abstained": false, "retrieved_units": [{"text": "[stripped: 103 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::o035", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::p1_b458"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 0, "span": [225004, 225107], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 1264 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::o035", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::p1_b455"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 1, "span": [223108, 224372], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 161 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::o039", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.en::p1_b483"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 2, "span": [229917, 230078], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 200 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32023R2854_data-act.