{"question_id": "V2-dev-LAW-en-T2-003", "approach": "B1", "approach_base": "B1", "flags": {}, "setting": "en-en", "q_lang": "en", "d_lang": "en", "corpus": "L", "corpus_set": "LAW_en", "answer_text": "No — it fails Article 18(c), which requires operating on a not-for-profit basis **and** being legally independent from any entity operating on a for-profit basis; being controlled by a for-profit pharmaceutical group breaches that independence requirement. For a qualifying entity that has submitted all necessary information under Article 19(4), the competent authority must register it within 12 weeks after receipt of the application, once it has evaluated and found compliance with Article 18. The registration is valid in all Member States.", "abstained": false, "retrieved_units": [{"text": "[stripped: 126 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::o026", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b280"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 0, "span": [135831, 135957], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 117 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::o026", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b283"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 1, "span": [136150, 136267], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 516 chars]", "doc_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::o027", "unit_ids": ["L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b303"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 2, "span": [139504, 140020], "meta": {}}], "evidence_units": ["L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b280", "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b283", "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en::p1_b303"], "evidence_items": [{"doc_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0868_data-governance-act.en", "section_id": "L.eurlex-32022R0